# Tomato Mozzarella Caprese

{ rating="4" image="tomato_mozzarella_caprese.jpg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

- [ ] [tomato]{ ing="tomato" }, sliced
- [ ] [mozzarella ball]{ ing="mozzarella-ball" }, sliced
- [ ] quality extra [virgin olive oil]{ ing="virgin-olive-oil" }
- [ ] [basil]{ ing="basil" }
- [ ] [oregano]{ ing="oregano" }
- [ ] [ground pepper]{ ing="ground-pepper" }
- [ ] [baguette]{ ing="baguette" }

## Recipe

1. Slice the [tomatoes]{ ing="tomato" } and [mozzarella]{ ing="mozzarella-ball" }. Drizzle [olive oil]{ ing="virgin-olive-oil" } on top with a small amount of balsamic vinegar
1. For the bread, add a bowl of [ground pepper]{ ing="ground-pepper" } and [olive oil]{ ing="virgin-olive-oil" } for dipping
